# Proto3 -> TBST broad transfer
#
# Source: Proto3Params1101.params (ArduPlane 4.7.0)
# Target baseline: tbst.params (ArduPlane 4.7.1)
# Generated: 2026-11-06
#
# Transfers all meaningful Proto3 configuration differences except:
#   - vehicle-specific sensor IDs, calibration/trim/scale, mounting orientation,
#     power-module measurement configuration, and sensor sampling configuration;
#   - the nine changed VTOL roll/pitch/yaw P, I, and D gains;
#   - mission/runtime counters and obsolete renamed parameters;
#   - TBST precision-landing and rangefinder configuration.
#
# GPS is explicitly routed as one logical GPS1 on the physical GPS2/SERIAL4 port.
# Q_TILT_ENABLE and QWIK_ENABLE expose parameter subgroups after reboot. Load this
# file, reboot and refresh parameters, then load it a second time and reboot again.
#
# Both source files have BATT_LOW_VOLT=0 and BATT_CRT_VOLT=0, so voltage triggers
# remain disabled. Proto3's QLand actions and 8-second timer are transferred.
#
